@startuml
' Class 7.6 Laporan dan EWS (F-09, F-10, U-02) — docs/proposal/07-data-dan-class.md
class RuntimeConfigurationVersion {
  +String scope_key
  +int revision
  +JSON settings
  +DateTime created_at
}
class AtRiskPolicy {
  +String scope_key
  +int revision
}
class Student {
  +String student_number
  +String full_name
}
class EwsFollowUp {
  +UUID student_id
  +UUID author_user_id
  +String status
  +DateTime resolved_at
  +String note
  +DateTime created_at
}
class AuditLog {
  +UUID actor_user_id
  +String action
  +String entity_type
  +UUID entity_id
  +UUID request_id
  +JSON before_state
  +JSON after_state
  +DateTime created_at
}
class User {
  +UUID id
  +String full_name
}
RuntimeConfigurationVersion "1" -- "0..1" AtRiskPolicy : scope attendance-at-risk-policy
AtRiskPolicy ..> Student : menghitung flag
Student "1" -- "0..*" EwsFollowUp : tindak lanjut (F-10 jalan)
User "1" -- "0..*" EwsFollowUp : penulis
User "1" -- "0..*" AuditLog : aktor (nullable)

note bottom of AtRiskPolicy
  AtRiskPolicy BUKAN tabel mandiri — view atas
  runtime_configuration_versions scope
  attendance-at-risk-policy (ambang di settings JSONB).
  EwsFollowUp (U-02, F-10) tabel nyata berjalan:
  status in {open, done} + resolved_at.
end note
@enduml
